@startuml Auction Creation Workflow - Activity Diagram

title Auction Creation Workflow - Activity Diagram

|#LightBlue|**Seller**|
start
:Select approved item;

:Fill auction details:
Starting bid, Buy now price, Duration;

:Validate form;

if (Form valid?) then (No)
  :Show validation errors;
  stop
else (Yes)
endif

:Submit create auction request;

|#LightGreen|**System**|
:Validate item exists;

if (Item valid?) then (No)
  |#LightBlue|**Seller**|
  :Return error;
  stop
else (Yes)
endif

|#LightGreen|**System**|
:Check item status is approved/pending;

:Check seller owns item;

:Check item has no active auction;

:Validate start time < end time;

if (All validations pass?) then (No)
  |#LightBlue|**Seller**|
  :Return validation error;
  stop
else (Yes)
endif

|#LightGreen|**System**|
:Determine auction status:
scheduled (if start time in future)
or active (if start time now);

:Create auction in database;

:Update item status to archived;

:Sync auction to vector database;

:Send SignalR real-time updates;

|#LightBlue|**Seller**|
:Auction created successfully;
stop

@enduml

